From 5961bc76bffa7bbca76a6be05a95d5ec87fe23fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ariel Aviad <aaviad@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 12 Jun 2025 14:26:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-190031] boot desc: move funcs to separate module

This patch removes some boot descriptor functions
and uses the boot descriptor module functions
instead
The functions to move are:
boot_desc_init()
boot_desc_get_img_desc()
boot_desc_release()
dev_spec_get_img_desc()

Change-Id: I783bd6e1af025ece5bdb7e58f74fa9ba4bf21e38
Signed-off-by: Ariel Aviad <aaviad@habana.ai>
---

